          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muganda gundi gwi Ihiiri ya Levi avi ihiiri ya Gerishoni vanyoola madaala manene gaviri mu kivala chi Ivugwi wa Manase. Lilala kugo liali Golani mu Bashani, liali lilala ku madaala guvuhaliru kandi Beeshetera, harara ni vivala viu vwayiru viago. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vanyoola madaala gandi gane kutura mu kivala chi ihiiri ya Isakari. Madaala yaga gaali: Kishioni, Daberazi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jaramuzi na Enganimu, harara ni vivala viu vwayiru viago. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutura mu kivala cha Asheri vanyoola madaala manene gane harara nivivala viu vwayiru viago. Madaala manene yaga gaali Mishali, Abudoni ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Helikazi na Rehobu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutura mu kivala cha Nafutali vanyoola madaala manene gavaga harara ni vivala viuvwayiru viago. Lilala ku madaala manene yaga liali Kedeshi mu Galilaya iliali lidaala liu vuhaliru. Madaala gandi yago gaali Hamozi Dori, na Karitani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Avandu vi zihiiri lugano lugano vi ihiiri ya Gerishomu vanyoola madaala manene goosi komi na tatu harara nivivala viuvwayiru viago.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
